      "description": "A white entry with a tactile fallback cover and adjacent title.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-cover\">The Waves</div><div class=\"ds-card-text\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">The Waves</h3><p class=\"ds-card-author\">Virginia Woolf</p><p class=\"ds-card-meta\">240 pages \u00b7 English</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;gap:20px;min-width:0;border-radius:14px;background:var(--bone,#ffffff);padding:20px;color:var(--ink,#252b28);transition:box-shadow 300ms var(--ease-library,cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1))}.ds-cover{width:96px;height:144px;flex-shrink:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:2px 6px 6px 2px;background:var(--leather,#365b47);color:var(--bone,#ffffff);padding:9px;font-family:var(--font-serif,Fraunces,Georgia,serif);font-size:12.48px;transform-origin:15% 70%;box-shadow:2px 4px 6px #2537281a,5px 10px 20px #25372812;transition:transform 380ms var(--ease-library,cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)),box-shadow 380ms var(--ease-library,cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1))}.ds-card-text{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-top:4px}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-serif,Fraunces,Georgia,serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.02em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-card-author{margin-top:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft,#4e5952)}.ds-card-meta{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-mute,#68716b)}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-card:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 24px #25372808}.ds-card:hover .ds-cover{transform:translateY(-4px) rotate(-2deg);box-shadow:3px 6px 8px #2537281a,7px 15px 24px #25372820}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card,.ds-cover{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
